      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is still happening. It's very easy to reproduce, since it occurs even with VRC built-ins like prints. Move a print, have someone else pick it up, and you'll see it teleport back to your original pickup point for a bit. This really breaks object movement smoothing systems, since they think the object flew really far away.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
